WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.230
You wear a lot of hats. And somehow, one thing takes the whole week. Leaving too little for family. For yourself.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:10.090
So,

00:00:10.545 --> 00:00:11.260
You pause.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:12.995
Write down what matters.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:20.200
Give each responsibility an hour or two. Draw a box. Give it a purpose. Add the tasks.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.180
That little plan becomes Spread.

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:27.440
Responsibilities, hours, your week, your tasks!

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:29.640
Make the hours count.
